# 2. Secured and monitored web infrastructure

## Scenario

A user wants to access `www.foobar.com`. This time, their browser connects over HTTPS. The request passes through a firewall before reaching the load balancer, then through more firewalls before reaching each server, and every component in the chain is being watched by a monitoring client.

